# Chuyển sang Supabase Auth

## Summary

Thay thế login flow hiện tại (RPC `invoice_verify_login` + localStorage) bằng Supabase Auth (`supabase.auth.signInWithPassword` + managed sessions). Giữ `invoice_accounts` làm fallback.

## Current Flow vs New Flow

| | Current | New (Supabase Auth) |
|---|---|---|
| **Login** | RPC `invoice_verify_login` | `supabase.auth.signInWithPassword()` |
| **Session** | `localStorage.invoice_user` + 30-day manual expiry | Supabase managed JWT + auto refresh |
| **User info** | `{id, username, role}` from RPC | `user.user_metadata.username/role` |
| **Logout** | `localStorage.removeItem()` | `supabase.auth.signOut()` |
| **State restore** | Manual localStorage parse | `supabase.auth.getSession()` |

## Proposed Changes

### Phase 1: Create Supabase Auth Users (DB only)

Create 2 auth users via Supabase Admin API with matching credentials:
- `admin@tdgames.local` / same password → metadata: `{username: "admin", role: "admin"}`
- `member@tdgames.local` / same password → metadata: `{username: "member", role: "member"}`

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Cần biết password gốc của 2 user để tạo Supabase Auth user. Passwords trong DB là bcrypt hashes — không decrypt được. **Bạn cần cung cấp password cho tôi, hoặc tôi sẽ set password mới.**

