### Phase 2: Update Frontend (4 files)

#### [MODIFY] [supabaseService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/invoice/services/supabaseService.ts)

Replace [loginWithCredentials](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/invoice/services/supabaseService.ts#395-407):
```typescript
export const loginWithCredentials = async (username: string, password: string): Promise<AccountUser> => {
  const email = `${username}@tdgames.local`;
  const { data, error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithPassword({ email, password });
  if (error) throw new Error('Đăng nhập thất bại.');
  const meta = data.user.user_metadata;
  return { id: data.user.id, username: meta.username || username, role: meta.role || 'member' };
};
```

Add `logoutFromAuth`:
```typescript
export const logoutFromAuth = async () => { await supabase.auth.signOut(); };
```

